Information om beskattningssammandrag 2019"}},{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/1050","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":[{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/470"},{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/472"}],"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/1052"},{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/1217"},{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/1219"},{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/1326"},{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/1328"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"avgifter"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"skatter"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"skattestatistik, beskattningssammandrag, 2019"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"statistik"}],"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/MONTHLY"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Beskattningssammandraget innehåller uppgifter om deklarerade inkomster samt avdrag i inkomstslagen tjänst, kapital och näringsverksamhet. Här redovisas uppgifter för hela riket. Du kan se uppgifterna fördelade på län, typ av skattebetalare (fysisk eller juridisk) samt genus."},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"10 juni 2020"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021005448"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Beskattnings­­sammandrag för inkomstår 2019"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/1049"}},{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/1051","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"INFO besksammandrag.docx"},{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/1052","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/1051"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/1051"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Preliminär debiteringsstatistik \nDet preliminära beskattningsutfallet för inkomstår 2019 (som deklareras 2020) planeras vara tillgängligt på webbplatsen följande datum: • Prognos 1 den 10 juni 2020 • Prognos 2 den 8 juli 2020 • Prognos 3 den 5 augusti 2019 • Prognos 4 den 28 augusti 2020 • Prognos 5 den 2 oktober 2020 • Prognos 6 den 29 oktober 2020 • Prognos 7 den 25 november 2020 \nSlutligt beskattningsutfall \nDen slutliga debiteringsstatistiken för inkomstår 2019 (som deklareras 2020) är tillgänglig från och med den 9 december 2020."},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/TXT"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Datum för publicering av beskattningssammandrag 2019"}},{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/1216","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:format":"text/csv","dct:title":"tyrb920x2_0039.csv"},{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/1217","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/1216"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/1216"},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-08"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"CSV fil - slutligt utfall inkomstår 2019"}},{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/1218","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"tyrb920x2_0039.xlsx"},{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/1219","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/res