2026) planeras vara tillgängligt på webbplatsen följande datum:\n•\tPrognos 1 den 9 april 2026\n•\tPrognos 2 den 7 maj 2026\n•\tPrognos 3 den 11 juni 2026\n•\tPrognos 4 den 2 juli 2026\n•\tPrognos 5 den 6 augusti 2026\n•\tPrognos 6 den 3 september 2026\n•\tPrognos 7 den 1 oktober 2026\n•\tPrognos 8 den 22 oktober 2026\n•\tPrognos 9 den 19 november 2026\nSlutligt beskattningsutfall\nDet slutliga beskattningsutfallet för inkomstår 2025 (som deklareras 2026) är tillgängligt från klockan 14:00 den 8 december 2026."},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/TXT"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Datum för publicering beskattningsutfall för inkomstår 2025"}},{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/2692","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:format":"text/csv","dct:title":"tyrb920x1_0101.csv"},{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/2693","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/2692"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/2692"},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-04-09"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"CSV fil - Prognos 1"}},{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/2694","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"tyrb920x1_0101.xlsx"},{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/2695","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/2694"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://skatteverket.entryscape.net/store/9/resource/2694"},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/